      "width": 1100,
      "height": 560,
      "data": {
        "title": "Ports",
        "body": "A face has a root, where the chain arrives (from the graph’s root, or the face before it), a surface delegate to borrow a Content node’s material, and a sequence-in and sequence-out that carry the chain from face to face.",
